            "detailed_description": "<i>[You do not need to have played the first game to play number 2. They both have their separate stories.]</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2>Awoken in the night by your doll. Speaking as if it possesses a mind of its own. The doll warns you of a monster that has come to take you away. Grab your flashlight and find the Boogeyman before he finds you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>•\tWatch.<br><br>•\tListen.<br><br>•\tBatteries will only last so long. Conserve power, or risk trying to charge them up.<br><br>•\tWeather will change each night, affecting the way you play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Support (Oculus Rift)</h2>The game supports full VR running at 90fps using the Oculus rift CV1 with minimum specs (GTX 970).",
